{
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Demo: FM Crystal Bells",
    "author": "SonicRack",
    "description": "Shimmering DX-style FM bells. Audio-rate sine modulates a sine VCO (Linear FM), gated by a square LFO into a plucky ADSR, then washed in a large reverb.",
    "tags": ["demo", "fm", "bells", "ambient", "reverb"],
    "category": "Demo",
    "created": "2026-07-30T12:00:00",
    "version": "1.0"
  },
